4. BREAK-EVEN
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  MC   0.89 scatters x 221.3 ns = 0.20 us per crossing
  GMC  72.97 us per crossing

One GMC crossing costs as much as 330 scattering events, and this
geometry has 0.9 per crossing, so cells must be
~370x optically thicker before GMC wins.

